atomic_spawn_copy.vlt:32:5: error: an async closure that may run on another thread captures `c`, whose `Hits` holds an `Atomic`
  = note: such a closure copies what it captured for each call, and changes to the copy's atomics would not reach `c`: share it so every task changes the same atomics: `const c = shared(new Hits(…))`

