  = note: such a closure copies what it captured for each call, and changes to the copy's atomics would not reach `o`: share it so every task changes the same atomics: `const o = shared(new Holder(…))`

atomic_spawn_copy.vlt:41:28: error: a closure whose promise may run on another thread captures `c`, whose `Hits` holds an `Atomic`
  = note: the promise it returns goes to the other task with a copy of what the closure passed on, and changes to the copy's atomics would not reach `c`: share it so every task changes the same atomics: `const c = shared(new Hits(…))`

